    "body": "Although I'm not sure how this is correct. Why is ProcessingInstruction an inherited interface and Comment is not?\r\n\r\nAlso, why would ShadowRoot not be a primary interface? Isn't that the most derived? And I think both Text and CDATASection are primary interfaces as they are the most derived on the objects they occur on. Just when CDATASection is the primary interface, it's also an inherited interface of Text.",
