    "body": "The suggested change seems incorrect, and then your further comment seems to be based on confusion about what the spec text would say after that incorrect change.\r\n\r\nI'll rephrase the original in another way. Every node's primary interface is one of:\r\n\r\n- Attr\r\n- CDATASection\r\n- Comment\r\n- Document\r\n- DocumentFragment\r\n- DocumentType\r\n- Element\r\n- HTMLElement\r\n- HTMLHtmlElement\r\n- ...\r\n- ProcessingInstruction\r\n- ShadowRoot\r\n- Text",
